                                "sense_id": "3ef33c30-f237-3f83-976b-c03e86828541",
                                "text": "His critics ask him if he expects to prevent the conferees in the Conference from talking to one another in the Metropolitan Club and from then coming to the Conference's open sessions merely to register the results of their secret conferrings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d03b8067-bd08-4b98-90b7-fd48b224f053",
                                "sense_id": "3ef33c30-f237-3f83-976b-c03e86828541",
                                "text": "A press conference was held at 1:30 with many representatives of the press from around the state eating lunch with the conferees."
                            }
